      "content": "That's a good start for the general vibe, but our casting director needs more specific \"types\" to differentiate the crowds. Like, when we're shooting in a park or a subway station, we want to see the different social circles that would actually be there. \n\nCan you break down the different cliques or groups you'd see in the Bronx in '75? Like, what are the different types of people hanging out on the corners versus the people just trying to get to work? We really want to capture the tension and the specific social makeup of the streets back then.",
